# Client proposal pages (api/demo.ts).
#
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. The demo gate protects the URL; it does nothing about the
# file, which is world-readable on GitHub the moment it is committed. A converted
# client's proposal — carrying her negotiated monthly rate — was readable at
# raw.githubusercontent.com with no auth for 31 days before anyone noticed
# (removed 2026-08-19).
#
# Proposals are the pages that carry commercial terms, so they never get committed.
# Demo hubs (preview.html, services.html) carry no pricing and are fine.
# Lumière is exempt: it is a fictitious showcase with no real client in it.
demos/*/proposal.html
!demos/lumiere/proposal.html
